# --- Glitch workspace (added by import) ---
# Base secret-hygiene ignores (stamped by the Glitch workspace scaffold).
# Reduces accidental staging of secret-NAMED files. It does NOT catch an in-file paste
# or anything already tracked — that needs the secret scan + pre-commit hook (spec §8.5).
*.pem
*.key
*credentials*
client_secret*.json
*token*.json
.mcp.json
*.mcp.json
.mcp.local.json
.planning/
STATE.md
CLAUDE.md
AGENTS.md

out/
.env
__pycache__/
# Pesados y regenerables gratis en cada sesión (exportar.py los recupera solo):
public/*/medios/
public/*/voz.wav
public/*/voz/cache/*.wav
# Se versionan a propósito: public/*/voz/cache/*.mp3 y *.json (evitan volver a pagar ElevenLabs),
# palabras.json, creditos.txt y entregas/ (para descargar los videos desde GitHub).
